0098: EDA83D                     std   PD.PLP,y     Clear out path descriptor list pointer
009B: A7A83F                     sta   PD.PST,y     Clear path status: Carrier not lost
009E: 3406                       pshs  d            Save 0 on stack
00A0: AEC816                     ldx   V.PDLHd,u    Get path descriptor list header pointer
00A3:                   * 05/25/93 mod - Boisy Pitre's non-sharable device patches
00A3:                   * 01/15/10 mod - Boisy Pitre redoes his non-sharable device patch
00A3: 2713                       beq   Yespath      No paths open, so we know we can open it
00A5:                   * IOMan has already vetted the mode byte of the driver and the descriptor
00A5:                   * and compared it to REGA of I$Open (now in PD.MOD of this current path).
00A5:                   * here we know there is at least one path open for this device.
00A5:                   * in order to properly support SHARE. (device exclusivity), we get the
00A5:                   * mode byte for the path we are opening and see if the SHARE. bit is set.
00A5:                   * if so, then we return error since we cannot have exclusivity to the device.
00A5:                            IFNE  H6309
00A5:                            tim   #SHARE.,PD.MOD,y
00A5:                            ELSE
00A5: A621                       lda   PD.MOD,y 
00A7: 8540                       bita  #SHARE.
00A9:                            ENDC
00A9: 2606                       bne   NoShare      
00AB:                   * we now know that the path's mode doesn't have the SHARE. bit set, so 
00AB:                   * we need to look at the mode of the path in the list header pointer to
00AB:                   * see if ITS SHARE. bit is set (meaning it wants exclusive access to the
00AB:                   * port).  If so we bail out
00AB:                            IFNE  H6309
00AB:                            tim   #SHARE.,PD.MOD,x
00AB:                            ELSE
00AB: A601                       lda   PD.MOD,x 
00AD: 8540                       bita  #SHARE.
00AF:                            ENDC
00AF: 270F                       beq   CkCar        Check carrier status
00B1: 3262              NoShare  leas  2,s          Eat extra stack (including good path count)
00B3: 53                         comb
00B4: C6FA                       ldb   #E$DevBsy    Non-sharable device busy error
00B6: 2031                       bra   OpenErr       Go detach device & exit with error
00B8:                            
00B8: 10AFC816          Yespath  sty   V.PDLHd,u    Save path descriptor ptr
00BC: 2012                       bra   L00F8        Go open the path
00BE:                   
00BE: 1F01              L00E6    tfr   d,x          Change to PD.PLP path descriptor
00C0: E6883F            CkCar    ldb   PD.PST,x     Get Carrier status
00C3: 2602                       bne   L00EF        Carrier was lost, don't update count
00C5: 6C61                       inc   1,s          Carrier not lost, bump up count of good paths
00C7: EC883D            L00EF    ldd   PD.PLP,x     Get path descriptor list pointer
00CA: 26F2                       bne   L00E6        There is one, go make it the current one
00CC: 10AF883D                   sty   PD.PLP,x     Save path descriptor ptr as path dsc. list ptr
00D0: 8629              L00F8    lda   #SS.Open     Internal open call
